> How do I find out my current base luck and/or item-added luck?

Enlightment (potion or wand) will give you some information, but
not an exact number.

Counting four leaf clovers at altar offerings doesn't work well
because those gains can be one or more so you can end up
higher than the count.  You can know when you've maxxed out
your luck because the clovers stop, though.  And there are other
ways that change your luck by exact amounts.  So basically you
need to count those other ways.

Most of the time you really want to know if your luck is negative,
zero, positive or maxed out.  Enlightment does tell -/0/+, clovers
do tell maxed.



